<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Security on Mahmoud Adel — Software Engineer — Python/Django/FastAPI, Linux/Docker | B.Sc. Software Engineering</title><link>https://zrun.dev/tags/security/</link><description>Recent content in Security on Mahmoud Adel — Software Engineer — Python/Django/FastAPI, Linux/Docker | B.Sc. Software Engineering</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 10:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zrun.dev/tags/security/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Hardening a Linux Server — SSH, Firewall, and Beyond</title><link>https://zrun.dev/blogs/linux-server-security-basics/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zrun.dev/blogs/linux-server-security-basics/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="introduction"&gt;Introduction&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Securing a Linux server is not optional — it&amp;rsquo;s essential. Whether you&amp;rsquo;re deploying a web application or managing infrastructure, these hardening steps will significantly reduce your attack surface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This guide is based on my experience in application security and Linux server administration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="1-ssh-hardening"&gt;1. SSH Hardening&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SSH is your primary access point — secure it first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id="disable-root-login"&gt;Disable Root Login&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit &lt;code&gt;/etc/ssh/sshd_config&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;PermitRootLogin no&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="use-key-based-authentication"&gt;Use Key-Based Authentication&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Generate key pair on your local machine&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;your_email@example.com&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Copy public key to server&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ssh-copy-id -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub user@server
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Disable password authentication&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;PasswordAuthentication no
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;PubkeyAuthentication yes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="change-default-port"&gt;Change Default Port&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Port &lt;span class="m"&gt;2222&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Use any port above 1024&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id="limit-login-attempts"&gt;Limit Login Attempts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="term-block" data-lang="bash"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-bar"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--red" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--amber" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-dot term-dot--green" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-title"&gt;bash — mahmoud@portfolio&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button type="button" class="term-copy" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-body"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;MaxAuthTries &lt;span class="m"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;LoginGraceTime &lt;span class="m"&gt;60&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-console"&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-output" aria-live="polite"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;div class="term-input-line"&gt;
 &lt;span class="term-prompt"&gt;mahmoud@portfolio ~ $&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;input type="text" class="term-input" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="type something…" aria-label="Type something into the terminal" /&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Restart SSH after changes:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>